e.lru"}, "provides_extra": null, "release_url": "https://pypi.org/project/repoze-lru/0.8/", "requires_dist": null, "requires_python": ">=3.10", "summary": "A tiny LRU cache implementation and decorator", "version": "0.8", "yanked": false, "yanked_reason": null}, "release_dates": {"0.1": "2009-06-15T01:51:50.270599Z", "0.2": "2009-06-15T10:23:39.771699Z", "0.3": "2009-06-16T08:40:57.429998Z", "0.4": "2011-09-04T22:08:51.659351Z", "0.5": "2012-03-24T19:12:35.419503Z", "0.6": "2012-07-12T20:48:40.720613Z", "0.7": "2017-09-07T05:01:00.007902Z", "0.8": "2026-05-16T16:57:27.257891Z"}}